<h3><u>Bujh gayi pyaas chacha</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>Bujh gayi pyaas chacha laut k ghr me aao,laut k gr me aao...<br />
Poori kar do ye dua,laut k ghr me aao..</p>

<p>1.Jaanti hoo ki kate aapke baazu ran mein<br />
Aap k baad bacha kya hai mere daman mein<br />
Kuch nahi karti gila,&nbsp; x2<br />
Laut k ghar me aao..</p>

<p>2.Hote jaate hai bohot shaam k gehre saaye<br />
Koi bhi ghar me nahi kaun mujhe behlaaye<br />
Tumko deti hoon sada,&nbsp;&nbsp; x2<br />
Laut k ghar me aao...</p>

<p>3.Mujhko maloom na tha door watan se aakar<br />
Aap so jaaenge darya pe alam lehraakar<br />
Lo chacha din bhi dhala,&nbsp;&nbsp; x2<br />
Laut k ghar me aao..</p>

<p>4.Ai chacha dekhiye chinti hai phupi ki chaadar<br />
Bhai sajjad ka khecha hai laeen ne bistar<br />
Kya nahi tumko pata,&nbsp; x2<br />
Laut k ghr me aao..</p>

<p>5.Maa ye kehti hai k hum qaid bhi honge ammu<br />
