Dekho daaman bhi jala,&nbsp; x2<br />
Laut k ghar me aao..</p>

<p>6.Nanhe jhoole me kabhi godd me madar k kabhi<br />
Dekhti hoo k mahak paaun kahi asgar ki<br />
Saath asgar ke chacha,&nbsp; x2<br />
Laut k ghar me aao..</p>

<p>7.Roke zainab ne kaha baali sakina meri<br />
