Kisko deti hai sada,&nbsp;&nbsp; x2<br />
Laut k ghar me aao...</p>

<p>8.Shaam se aaj bhi zaair jo koi aata hai<br />
Saath rehan wo paigaam yahi laata hai,<br />
Mai hoon zindaan mein chacha,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; x2<br />
Laut k ghar me aao...</p>
